{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to Velocity Rush, a racing game that will take you to a world of high speeds, bright colors and endless adrenaline! Choose from six unique cars, each with its own features and driving style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game features incredible visual effects stylized as futuristic neon and a soundtrack that will make your heart beat faster. Each race is a test of your reactions and your ability to keep your cool at extreme speeds. Will you be able to become the champion by overtaking all your rivals?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Game Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Six unique cars with different speed and control characteristics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Artificial intelligence of opponents, adapting to your style of play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Stylized visual style inspired by neon and futuristic design.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Speed gameplay designed for adrenaline junkies.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3515230?t=1744198474","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3515230?t=1744198474","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515230/5ff6373374b31d6034569961a954192c80bf1f37/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744198474","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515230/5ff6373374b31d6034569961a954192c80bf1f37/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744198474","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to Velocity Rush, a racing game that will take you to a world of high speeds, bright colors and endless adrenaline! Choose from six unique cars, each with its own features and driving style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game features incredible visual effects stylized